      "transliteration": "su(n)dhar saroop ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਹ) ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸ਼ੋਭਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
