      "transliteration": "kaaddee kravaal ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ (ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ ਮਾਰਨ ਲਈ ਸਦਾ) ਤਲਵਾਰ ਕਢੀ ਰਖਦਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "काढी क्रवाल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101108",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0059",
      "lineIndex": 59,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਮ ਤੇਜ ਭਾਨੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sam tej bhaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦਾ) ਤੇਜ ਸੂਰਜ ਵਰਗਾ ਸੀ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सम तेज भानु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101109",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0060",
      "lineIndex": 60,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜ੍ਵਾਲਾ ਸਮਾਨ ॥੯੭॥",
      "transliteration": "javaiaalaa samaan ||97||",
      "translation": "When he drew his sword, he was like KAL (death) for his enemies, and his magnificence was like the fires of the sun.97.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਥਵਾ ਅਗਨੀ ਦੇ ਸਮਾਨ ਸੀ ॥੯੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ज्वाला समान ॥९७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101110",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0061",
      "lineIndex": 61,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਬ ਜੁਰਤ ਜੰਗ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jab jurat ja(n)g ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਦ ਯੁੱਧ ਵਿਚ ਰੁਝ ਜਾਦਾ ਸੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जब जुरत जंग ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101111",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0062",
      "lineIndex": 62,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਹਿ ਮੁਰਤ ਅੰਗ ॥",
      "transliteration": "neh murat a(n)g ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤਾ (ਯੁੱਧ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚੋਂ) ਅੰਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਮੋੜਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नहि मुरत अंग ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101112",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0063",
      "lineIndex": 63,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਰਿ ਭਜਤ ਨੇਕ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ar bhajat nek ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਨੇਕ ਵੈਰੀ ਭਜ ਜਾਦੇ ਸਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अरि भजत नेक ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101113",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0064",
      "lineIndex": 64,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਹਿ ਟਿਕਤ ਏਕ ॥੯੮॥",
      "transliteration": "neh Tikat ek ||98||",
      "translation": "When he fought, none of his limbs turned back, none of his enemies could stand before him and thus ran away.98.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਕ ਵੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਟਿਕਦਾ ਸੀ ॥੯੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नहि टिकत एक ॥९८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101114",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0065",
      "lineIndex": 65,
      "gurmukhi": "ਥਰਹਰਤ ਭਾਨੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tharaharat bhaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੇ ਪ੍ਰਤਾਪ ਤੋਂ) ਸੂਰਜ ਥਰਥਰ ਕੰਬਦਾ ਸੀ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "थरहरत भानु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101115",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0066",
      "lineIndex": 66,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੰਪਤ ਦਿਸਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ka(n)pat dhisaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦਿਸ਼ਾਵਾ ਡੋਲਦੀਆਂ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कंपत दिसान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101116",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0067",
      "lineIndex": 67,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੰਡਤ ਮਵਾਸ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ma(n)ddat mavaas ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਆਕੀ ਰਹਿਣ ਵਾਲੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मंडत मवास ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101117",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0068",
      "lineIndex": 68,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭਜਤ ਉਦਾਸ ॥੯੯॥",
      "transliteration": "bhajat udhaas ||99||",
      "translation": "The sun trembled before him, the directions shivered, the opponents stood with bowed heads and would run away in anxiety.99.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਦਾਸ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਭਜੇ ਜਾ ਰਹੇ ਸਨ ॥੯੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भजत उदास ॥९९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101118",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0069",
      "lineIndex": 69,
      "gurmukhi": "ਥਰਹਰਤ ਬੀਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tharaharat beer ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬੀਰ ਥਰਥਰ ਕੰਬਦੇ ਸਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "थरहरत बीर ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101119",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0070",
      "lineIndex": 70,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭੰਭਰਤ ਭੀਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bha(n)bharat bheer ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਡਰਪੋਕ ਭਜੇ ਜਾ ਰਹੇ ਸਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भंभरत भीर ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101120",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0071",
      "lineIndex": 71,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਤਜਤ ਦੇਸ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tatajat dhes ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੇਸ ਛਡ ਰਹੇ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ततजत देस ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101121",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0621_line_0072",
      "lineIndex": 72,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪਮਨਿ ਨਰੇਸ ॥੧੦੦॥",
      "transliteration": "nirapaman nares ||100||",
      "translation": "The warriors trembled, the cowards fled and the kings of various countries would break before him like thread.100.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ) ਸ਼ਿਰੋਮਣੀ ਰਾਜਾ ਸੀ ॥੧੦੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 621,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृपमनि नरेस ॥१००॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101122",
      "sourceShabadId": "9300",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    }
  ]
}
